{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"options\": [\n    {\n      \"line\": \"欢喜里压着沉重的牵挂。因为他早已把亲近当作安稳的依靠，如今倾注得越深，越切身地感到失去它会痛。\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"他开始体验到，投入越深，亲近带来的幸福越会牵动对失去的痛感。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 8,\n      \"why\": \"此前亲近已成为他的安稳依靠，而全心投入使失去的代价更加切身，能解释幸福中为何出现沉重的牵挂。\",\n      \"uses\": [\n        \"候选8\",\n        \"候选14\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"line\": \"他心里绷得很紧，投入的热烈也带上了压力。旧日克制带来的掌控感与倾注心意的充实相冲，让他这次的投入格外沉重。\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"他开始体验到，旧日克制带来的掌控感，会在全心投入时转成压力。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 7,\n      \"why\": \"克制带来的掌控感与投入带来的满足都有明确的前史，因此可以把这段的紧绷理解为两种重要需要之间的冲突。\",\n      \"uses\": [\n        \"候选15\",\n        \"候选16\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b56c47b2-6dba-4a15-a118-254dccf2da73", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T025842951326Z", "elapsed_seconds": 74.438, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T02:59:57.382912+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "6dc008bed407922373a06c6be263dcab8f88b3d4fa8e145fb59ff660b6e81133", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30